# The learn is the ability's, so its controller learns (CR 603.3a, 603.10a): the Eyetwitch dies under Bot2's control (Bot2's
# Sudden Substitution swaps its own Bolt for Bot1's Eyetwitch, so Bot1 holds the Bolt and aims it at the Eyetwitch). The card
# goes to its owner Bot1's graveyard, but Bot2 learns: declining the discard, Bot2 may bring in a Lesson from Bot2's own
# sideboard (Price of Freedom), never Bot1's (Firebending Lesson). Bot1 learns nothing.

